<div class="govuk-width-container">
  <div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
      <h1 class="govuk-heading-xl">Claim funding for mentor training</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="govuk-grid-row">
    <div class="govuk-grid-column-two-thirds">
      <p class="govuk-body">Use this service to:</p>

      <%= govuk_list type: :bullet do %>
        <li>claim funding for eligible initial teacher training (ITT) mentor training</li>
        <li>review mentor training claims selected for audit</li>
      <% end %>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Who can use this service</h2>

      <h3 class="govuk-heading-s">Schools and educational organisations</h3>

      <p class="govuk-body">You can use this service if your organisation:</p>

      <%= govuk_list type: :bullet do %>
        <li>offers ITT placements with an accredited provider</li>
        <li>has at least one team member who has started or is due to start ITT mentor training</li>
        <li>is registered with <%= govuk_link_to "Get Information About Schools (GIAS)", "https://get-information-schools.service.gov.uk" %></li>
      <% end %>

      <%= govuk_inset_text do %>
        This funding is not available for training early career framework (ECF) mentors. To claim for ECF mentors, <%= govuk_link_to "you need a different service", "https://manage-training-for-early-career-teachers.education.gov.uk" %>.
      <% end %>

      <h3 class="govuk-heading-s">Accredited ITT providers</h3>

      <p class="govuk-body">You can use this service when claims involving your organisation are selected for audit.</p>

      <p class="govuk-body">You can:</p>

      <%= govuk_list type: :bullet do %>
        <li>review claims selected for audit</li>
        <li>approve claims supported by your records</li>
        <li>identify discrepancies where training records do not support all or part of a claim</li>
        <li>submit audit responses through the service</li>
      <% end %>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">When schools can submit a claim</h2>

      <% if claim_window_open? %>
        <p class="govuk-body">For the school year starting <%= l(academic_year.starts_on, format: "%B %Y") %>:</p>

        <%= govuk_list type: :bullet do %>
          <li>schools can add ITT mentor training hours and submit a claim from <%= l(claim_window.starts_on, format: "%B %Y") %></li>
          <li>registered users will receive email reminders about claim opening dates and deadlines</li>
        <% end %>
      <% else %>
        <p class="govuk-body">The claim window for the current academic year has now closed. Schools cannot submit new claims at this time. Accredited ITT providers can continue to access the service to complete audit activities where required.</p>

        <p class="govuk-body">Information about future claim windows will be published when available.</p>
      <% end %>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Before schools start a claim</h2>

      <p class="govuk-body">You will need:</p>

      <%= govuk_list type: :bullet do %>
        <li>the name of your accredited ITT provider</li>
        <li>your mentors’ teacher reference numbers (TRN)</li>
        <li>your mentors’ dates of birth</li>
        <li>completed training hours, which should be checked with your provider</li>
      <% end %>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Sign in</h2>

      <p class="govuk-body">To access this service, you will be asked to sign in or create a Department for Education (DfE) Sign-in account. DfE Sign-in is how schools, accredited providers and other education organisations access DfE online services.</p>

      <%= govuk_start_button text: "Start now", href: sign_in_path, classes: "govuk-!-margin-top-4" %>

      <h2 class="govuk-heading-m">Get a claim funding for mentor training account</h2>

      <p class="govuk-body">
        Most eligible organisations will automatically be set up with an account to claim funding for mentor training.
      </p>

      <p class="govuk-body">
        If you cannot access your organisation’s account, you may need to ask a colleague to add you.
      </p>

      <p class="govuk-body">
        If your organisation is eligible but has not been set up with an account, send an email to <%= mail_to t("claims.support_email"), t("claims.support_email_html") %>. You will get a response within 5 working days.
      </p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>
